# Total Upkeep — agent conventions

- Product name: **Total Upkeep**; slug / text domain: **`boldgrid-backup`**. Do not rename either for lint cosmetics.
- Follow [`phpcs.xml.dist`](phpcs.xml.dist) and [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md). Claude Code: also [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md).
- Scratch: project `.cursor/working/` for repo-local work; `$HOME/tmp/` for cross-project downloads/clones. Never system `/tmp/`.
- Public GitHub surfaces: no devel hostnames, QA accounts, internal paths, or security-embargo detail — put that on Jira (`imh-internal`).
- Prefer minimal diffs; do not drive-by reformat unrelated code.
- When opening PRs for internal work: Jira parent + Dev/Review sub-tasks; branch `ENG7-####-short-slug`; PR title includes the Jira key.
- Security relocation workflows: `.claude/skills/pr-content-to-jira`, `move-pr-to-private-ghsa`, `repost-pr-reviews-to-tpf`.
